Error [jet.ProhibitedEffectReached]: `top` reaches `#Unsafe` code, but Unsafe is denied here
  --> tests/ui/unsafe_effect_prohibition_transitive.jet:9:14
    |
  9 | top: fn() -[!Unsafe]> { middle() }
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: `peek` opens the `#Unsafe` gate at unsafe_effect_prohibition_transitive.jet:4; `top` and every callee it can reach must stay out of `#Unsafe` code when Unsafe is denied
 Fix: Remove the `#Unsafe` gate from `peek` or stop calling it, or drop the `-[!Unsafe]>` prohibition
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: top → middle → peek
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0749
